    "sentence_translations": [
      "9. The Ninth Minute",
      "",
      "Miss Zhong treated Mr. Gao to coffee. They were talking. They were very happy.",
      "",
      "“You can speak English, right? Where did you learn it?” Miss Zhong said.",
      "",
      "“I studied at a university in the UK, so my English is very good,” Mr. Gao said.",
      "",
      "“Wait a minute, I also went to university in the UK,” Miss Zhong said.",
      "",
      "“Really? Which year did you go to the UK?” Mr. Gao said.",
      "",
      "“I went to the UK in 2016. How about you?” Miss Zhong said.",
      "",
      "“I also went to the UK in 2016!” Mr. Gao said.",
      "",
      "“Really? Did we both go to the UK in 2016?",
      "That’s so interesting!” Miss Zhong said.",
      "",
      "Mr. Gao smiled and said, “This is very interesting!”",
      "",
      "Mr. Gao drank coffee. He looked at Miss Zhong.",
      "",
      "Did they really only know each other for nine minutes? For some reason, Mr. Gao felt like they were old friends …"
    ]
  }
